\**{c=red:Note:}** At several points, your progress in navigating {z:Outer Ra'Kaznar} may be interrupted by several {p:Colonization Reives|Colonization Reive}. If you have not done so already, talk to {n:Lerene} standing at (N-7) near the zone to {z:Kamihr Drifts} to start the Quest {q:Lerene's Lament|Lerene's Lament|Lerene's Lament}, which requires trading her 2 {i:Ancestral Cloth|Ancestral Cloth|8751} to receive the {@k} {k:"Pulverizing"} Key Item. This will allow you to damage and destroy the **Amaranth Barriers** blocking progress into the zone.
* {i:Ancestral Cloth|Ancestral Cloth|8751} is a common from Shunned enemies in the room located at (K-7)/(K-8).

=2 Walkthrough
* Head to {z:Outer Ra'Kaznar} by using the **Liseran Door: Entrance** in {z:Kamihr Drifts} (F-8).
** If previously unlocked, you can use the {p:Waypoint}: {p:Enigmatic Device} > {z:Outer Ra'Kaznar}.
* In {z:Outer Ra'Kaznar}, find and examine the following location:
** **Effigy of Sealing** at (I-11) (Upstairs, Map 1) to receive the {@k} {k:Starblessed scale}.
** **Silvery Plate** at (C-7) (Upstairs, Map 1) to receive the {@k} {k:Silvery plate}.
*** **{c=red:Note:}** Do not proceed to next scale before picking up this Key Item. It allows use of the elevator at (I-6) (Upstairs, Map 1) to reach last scale.
** **Effigy of Sealing** at (H-2) (Upstairs, Map 1) to receive the {@k} {k:Moontouched scale}.
** **Demonic Architrave** at (C-8) (Basement, Map 2) to receive the {@k} {k:Sunkissed scale}.
*** While the scales can be collected in any order, it is highly recommended to use the order provided above due to the natural flow of traversing throughout the zone.
*** **(Optional)**: After collecting any scale, minor additional cutscenes become available at both the **Alpine Trail** at (H-5) in {z:Kamihr Drifts} and the {z:Celennia Memorial Library}. Even if they are not triggered by returning halfway through the Mission, they can still be watched at the {p:Goblin Footprint} at (K-11) in {z:Kamihr Drifts} and by talking to {n:Jedelaih} in the {z:Celennia Memorial Library} respectively.
**** There are no additional scenes for having collected two scales.
* After collecting all the items, return to {z:Kamihr Drifts} - Biovauc #3 (or Home Point) again and examine the **Alpine Trail** at (H-5) for a cutscene and the {@k} {k:World Tree sapling}.

